# What the tools need to run: the SQL converter (scalardb_migrate/, skills/sql-transpile), the PL/SQL tools
# (plsql/) and the skills' scripts. bin/python installs exactly the lock compiled from this file, requirements.txt.
# After changing a line here, compile the locks again (the command is at the top of each of them):
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt --universal --python-version 3.10 --generate-hashes
# and the same for requirements-dev.in and requirements-difftest.in, which include this file.
